Package: zzfisher
Title: Fisher's Exact Test for r x 2 Contingency Tables
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ronald G.", "Thomas", , "rgthomas@ucsd.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1686-4965"))
Description: Multiple algorithmic implementations of Fisher's exact test
    for r x 2 contingency tables, with first-generation kernels for
    r x c tables and r x c x k tables under the no-three-way-interaction
    model. Includes tree-based (mode-centric traversal with pruning) and
    network-based (state-space enumeration with Vandermonde bulk-sum)
    approaches in pure R, C, and C++. User-facing functions dispatch on
    the shape of the input table.
License: GPL (>= 3)
